### Mock third-party API dependencies using page.route

Source: https://github.com/microsoft/playwright/blob/main/docs/src/best-practices-js.md

Intercept requests to third-party endpoints using page.route and fulfill them with mock data. This avoids test instability and slowdowns caused by external dependencies.

```javascript
await page.route('**/api/fetch_data_third_party_dependency', route => route.fulfill({
  status: 200,
  body: testData,
}));
await page.goto('https://example.com');
